    "description": "This classic Victorian condo has been thoughtfully updated w/ modern touches. Discover period details like crown molding & vaulted ceilings, paired w/ contemporary features such as electronic & audio integration. \n\nStep inside & be captivated by the cathedral-like entryway, flooding the space w/ natural light. The piece de resistance is the private roof deck, a serene oasis with stunning city views. Experience the perfect blend of historic charm & modern comfort in this one-of-a-kind penthouse.\n\nProperty highlights: \n- Fully stocked, sleek kitchen with modern appliances\n- Living/dining spaces that blend classic Victorian charm with modern conveniences\n- Two indoor fireplaces\n- Expansive private roof deck, complete with a fully functional outdoor kitchen & stunning views of iconic San Francisco landmarks like Sutro Tower, St. Ignatius Church, & Buena Vista Park\n- In-unit washer & dryer\n- Garage parking for two cars\n- Central location next to public transit stop between the charming neighborhoods of Cole Valley & Buena Vista Heights, steps away from the best San Francisco has to offer\n\nUp to three pets allowed. Minimum stay of 30 days. Smoking is prohibited."
